    <div class="vrsplit">
      <div class="ch-head v"><div class="no">06<small>VR</small></div><div class="h"><h2>Standing next to it before it exists</h2><p class="lede">We built a night-time street and the pole in Unreal Engine and tested the final concept in VR. A user walks up, reads the screen, then presses the emergency button: a silent alarm first, then hold for a loud one.</p></div></div>
