<section class="ch" id="ways">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="ch-head"><div class="no" aria-hidden="true">✓<small>Takeaways</small></div><div class="h"><h2>How we worked</h2></div></div>
    <div class="ways">
      <div><h3>Test at every fidelity</h3><p>Cardboard, Figma, 3D and VR each answered a different question. Cheap prototypes let us change direction early.</p></div>
      <div><h3>Design with stakeholders, not only users</h3><p>A police officer and an engineer shaped the camera, the alarm and what was realistic to build and maintain.</p></div>
      <div><h3>Inclusive by default</h3><p>Accessibility followed Canadian standards from the start: AODA text sizing, screen height for wheelchair users and braille.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
